{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37736","headline":"渭阳楼闲望 · 郑谷","name":"渭阳楼闲望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千重二华见皇州，望尽凝岚即此楼。\n细雨不藏秦树色，夕阳空照渭河流。\n後车宁见前车覆，今日难忘昨日忧。\n扰扰尘中犹未已，可能疏傅独能休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}